{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 27, :comments ["<b>All the words of Joseph.</b> He had given them a sign — what he was engaged in when he parted from him: the passage of the heifer whose neck is broken. That is what is meant by <b>and he saw the wagons that Joseph sent</b> — and it is not written 'that Pharaoh sent.'" "<b>And the spirit of Jacob revived.</b> The Shechinah rested upon him — for it had departed from him."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 45, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:03:38.233285381Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}